    "chunk_text": "on sceolan \u00feonne se dom cym\u00f0, nu we \u00fe\u00e6ne fyrst Be\u00feence gehwa hine sylfne be \u00f0am \u00fee he wille, ne cym\u00f0 ure \u00e6fre \u00e6nig to Godes rice \u00e6r we beon \u00e6fre Leofan men, God ge\u00feafa\u00f0 \u00feam deofle Antecriste \u00fe\u00e6t he mot ehtan godra manna, for\u00f0am \u00fee hi sculon, \u00dea \u00feonne \u00fee his leasungum gelyfa\u00f0 & him to gebuga\u00f0, \u00feam he byrh\u00f0 her for worulde & \u00f0a he weor\u00fea\u00f0 Se gesawenlica deofol wyrc\u00f0 fela wundra & seg\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he God sylfa beo, & mid his gedwimerum m\u00e6st Gyf hi \u00f0onne \u00fe\u00e6t nella\u00f0, \u00feonne sculan hi ehtnessa mycle & eac earmlicne dea\u00f0 ge\u00f0olian. Eala, ges\u00e6lig bi\u00f0 \u00feeah se \u00f0e to \u00feam anr\u00e6de bi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he for\u00f0am ne awaca\u00f0; ac witodlice \u00fe\u00e6ra bi\u00f0 ealles Ure Drihten Crist geh\u00e6lde fela \u00fe\u00e6ra on life \u00fee unhale w\u00e6ron, & se deofol Antecrist gebroca\u00f0 & Ac sy\u00f0\u00f0an he \u00fe\u00e6ne mann gebrocod h\u00e6f\u00f0, sy\u00f0\u00fean he m\u00e6g don swylce he hine geh\u00e6le, gyf he geswic\u00f0 He bi\u00f0 eal unwrenca full. \u00d0onne beswic\u00f0 he swy\u00f0e fela manna \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t he gebroca\u00f0 m\u00e6nige man dihlice & geh\u00e6l\u00f0 eft \u00c6lc yfel he m\u00e6g don, & \u00e6lc he de\u00f0. He de\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t fyr cym\u00f0 ufene, swylce hit of heofonum cume, & he mid \u00feam fela forb\u00e6rn\u00f0, ealswa he Ac se \u00f0e for \u00fe\u00e6s fyres ege",
